n>: I start on February 8th, as you know.  In May, I will have worked there for three months and hopefully during that time, I will have been working closely with some of my talented colleagues. By then, I feel that I will have learned enough that my role will be increased beyond just assistant editing. I want to make an impact right out of the gate and certainly don't want to get off on the wrong foot.   I also have some bills that must be paid and a student loan that should be addressed.<br />", "id": 1}, {"time": "51000", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Well, you seem to be on the right track. You wanted to buy a car, didn't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: What I want is a used car.  In August, I will hopefully have saved enough money to buy one.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca:</span> That sounds like a plan, but you're not finished, are you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Nope. I have a plethora of ideas.  It should be mentioned that I received another text from Boris today.\nWhat he wanted was to tell me about another editorial assistant job. They are looking for another editorial assistant and they thought I might know someone. The job starts the week after mine does.<br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "92000", "image": "engenn9le16ob11re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: You are going to ask Adam, aren't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Good idea! I'll text him right now!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Are you sure? What worries me is that you are new and if Adam doesn't do a good job, it may reflect badly on you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Oh, he'll be fine. It's an ideal job for him. Don't worry!<br />", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}